{"id": "42357875", "result_url": "https://cdn1.printidea.art/album/230420/a217a25f49d8498a976e93f279a0bfed-0.jpeg", "user_id": "2500255", "prompt": "The use of Dianbao hardware devices allows people to easily borrow shared Dianbao through mobile app mini programs.\n1. Shared power bank terminal: The physical part of the entire system, which is also visible to us, is used to store the power bank. The cabinet usually comes with a QR code. The difference between different products is the biggest, mainly reflected in size, whether there is a touch screen, and the delivery method of the power bank. The terminal is also divided into a mechanical part and an electronic control part. The electronic control part controls the mechanical part through software programming to store the power bank.\n2. WeChat official account or Alipay service account or APP client: This is the client for users to operate, usually WeChat official account or Alipay service account. Some products have APP, and the functions achieved are similar, mainly including the borrowing and returning process, fee payment, deposit payment and withdrawal.\n3. Cloud server: It is the central control of the entire system, connecting all other parts and implementing corresponding business processes.\n4. Merchant management backend: Usually, when renting power bank cabinets, agents will be developed. Agents need to understand the operation of the cabinets, and through the management backend, they can view relevant operation data, fees, etc.\n5. System management background: The management background can view the operation status and usage data of all power bank rental cabinet", "resolution_power": "512x512", "proportion": "1:1", "NSFW": "Unsure"}
